{"completed": true, "response": "{\"mechanisms\":[{\"index\":1,\"usable\":true,\"why\":\"理由具体且有推导：先前已经实际享受到亲近的愉快，因此这份亲近对他更可珍惜；越珍惜，就越舍不得它结束，于是同样的亲近在此刻会带上更强的急切和留恋。这不是把“更强烈”换词重说，也没有虚构对白、往事或人物习惯。其关键前提可由H2及S02-B1、S02-B4支撑。\",\"flags\":[]}],\"coverage\":[{\"id\":\"S04-B1\",\"status\":\"explained\",\"why\":\"本颗最需要解释的是熟悉的亲近为何这一遍显得更迫切。先前已经享受过这份亲近，继而更珍惜、也更舍不得结束，足以说明迫切感为什么在重现时加深。华丽花腔和反复补述主要是声音与类比，不必另立人物往事。\"},{\"id\":\"S04-B2\",\"status\":\"explained\",\"why\":\"珍惜加深而又舍不得结束，使情意在高潮处既更想充分显露，又带着急切和不稳，因此能够承接炽热、颤抖、近乎完全打开却没有安稳落下的感受；不需要另补一个“决定表白”之类的心理步骤。\"},{\"id\":\"S04-B3\",\"status\":\"explained\",\"why\":\"这一颗承载的是抓紧、挽留以及越想留住越显不安的感觉。“越享受其中，越舍不得它结束”直接给出了为什么手会仿佛不自觉握紧、为什么出现牢牢抓住当下的冲动。\"},{\"id\":\"S04-B4\",\"status\":\"explained\",\"why\":\"这是机制最直接覆盖的一颗：美好仍在，却因为太珍惜而提前舍不得它过去，于是甜蜜与鼻酸、想让这一刻多停留并存，和S02-B4已有的留恋也连续。\"}],\"section_pass\":true,\"problems\":[],\"unexplained\":[],\"reason\":\"整段足够。选中的解释虽然短，但给出了明确对象“这份亲近”和有效因果链：已经得到真实满足→更珍惜亲近→更舍不得结束→欢喜中出现急切与留恋。这个原因能够同时解释本段的迫切、炽热而不稳、抓紧以及甜蜜中的鼻酸，不必把每颗听感再拆成独立心理步骤。历史中真正被本段调用的H2有原始听感支撑，H3也可由此前的留恋与S03的沉浸感衔接；没有把本段“谈往事”“说出口”“握手”等类比实化成人物事实。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3c577e06-a764-450b-a25f-7404f3da1909", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T050456733471Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.234, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T05:05:51.968685+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3c944c7561dfb7cb4e921a06b66a6ca40a479608594389728616775de1726fe6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T050456733471Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f75709bfadde9c075ca9c3129ed4d4960f2acd1ab01d55e7af74879aabc2a74f"}}}
